1. a new user signs in; the Data nav item opens the Overview: being set up
  GET /api/me 200
  GET /api/me 200
  GET /api/data-store 200
  GET /api/data-store 200
  GET /api/data-store 200
  GET /api/data-store 200
   ok: Overview says the store is being set up
2. Documents while it's being set up: no upload
   ok: Upload is disabled while the store is set up
3. the provisioning worker starts; the page sees the store become ready
  GET /api/data-store 200
  GET /api/data-store 200
  GET /api/documents 200
   ok: Upload is enabled once the store is ready
4. upload two files from the Data page: one ingests, one fails
  GET /api/me 200
  GET /api/me 200
  GET /api/data-store 200
  GET /api/data-store 200
  GET /api/documents 200
  POST /api/documents 201
  POST /api/documents 201
  GET /api/documents 200
   ok: hedgehogs.md shows it's in progress (hedgehogs.md /  / Uploaded Oct 16, 2026, 8:42 AM /  / Waiting)
  GET /api/documents 200
  GET /api/documents 200
  GET /api/documents 200
   broken.md: broken.md /  / Uploaded Oct 16, 2026, 8:42 AM /  / UnicodeDecodeError: 'utf-8' codec can't decode byte 0xff in position 0: invalid start byte /  / Failed
   ok: the failure's error is shown
   ok: the upload time is shown
5. upload from the chat's panel; it appears on the Data page and follows its ingest
  GET /api/me 200
  GET /api/me 200
  GET /api/data-store 200
  GET /api/data-store 200
  GET /api/documents 200
  POST /api/documents 201
  GET /api/documents 200
  GET /api/data-store 200
  GET /api/data-store 200
  GET /api/documents 200
  GET /api/documents 200
   otters.md on the Data page: otters.md /  / Uploaded Oct 16, 2026, 8:42 AM /  / Processing
  GET /api/documents 200
  GET /api/documents 200
   ok: otters.md reached ready on the Data page without a reload
6. delete hedgehogs.md: gone from the list and from search
  GET /api/me 200
  GET /api/me 200
  GET /api/search?q=hedgehogs+eat+beetles&limit=8 200
  GET /api/search?q=hedgehogs+eat+beetles&limit=8 200
  GET /api/me 200
  GET /api/me 200
  GET /api/data-store 200
  GET /api/data-store 200
  GET /api/documents 200
  DELETE /api/documents/1 204
  GET /api/documents 200
   ok: the other documents stay
  GET /api/me 200
  GET /api/me 200
  GET /api/search?q=hedgehogs+eat+beetles&limit=8 200
  GET /api/search?q=hedgehogs+eat+beetles&limit=8 200
   search hits after delete: ["otters.md","otters.md"]
   ok: search no longer finds hedgehogs.md
7. each section's URL opens it directly
